---
layout: base.njk
title: "Tell us your problem — Nirmaan"
description: "Describe the problem in your own words. No spec or technical knowledge needed. Nirmaan works out the system you actually need and replies within 24 hours."
ogDescription: "You bring the problem. We build the system. Describe it in your own words and we'll reply within 24 hours."
permalink: "/contact.html"
scripts: ["contact-form.js"]
nav: "contact"
head:
  eyebrow: "You bring the problem"
  lines: ["What's getting", "in your way?"]
  accent: 1
  lede: "You don't need to know whether you need a website, an app or an automation. Tell us what's going wrong; working out the right system is our job."
  glyph: "00100/00010/11111/00010/00100"
  actions:
    - { label: "See pricing first", href: "/pricing.html" }
---
<section class="section" aria-label="Enquiry">
  <div class="wrap contact">

    <form class="form intake" id="enquiry" data-enquiry novalidate
          {%- if site.web3formsKey %}
          data-endpoint="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"
          data-format="web3forms"
          data-access-key="{{ site.web3formsKey }}"
          {%- else %}
          data-endpoint="{{ site.intakeEndpoint }}"
          data-format="json"
          {%- endif %}
          data-fallback-email="{{ site.email }}"
          aria-labelledby="enquiry-title">
      <div>
        <h2 class="form__title" id="enquiry-title">Tell us your problem</h2>
        <p class="form__intro">No spec needed. Describe what's going wrong in your own words and we'll work out what should be built. We reply within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      {#- What the visitor clicked to get here (?plan=, ?care=, ?service=), shown
          so they know we know, and sent with the enquiry as `interest`. -#}
      <script type="application/json" data-interests>{{ pricing | interests(serviceList) | dump | safe }}</script>
      <div class="interest" data-interest hidden>
        <div class="interest__copy">
          <span class="mono">You're asking about</span>
          <a class="interest__name" href="/pricing.html" data-interest-link></a>
          <span class="interest__detail" data-interest-detail></span>
        </div>
        <button class="interest__clear" type="button" data-interest-clear>Not sure yet</button>
        <input type="hidden" name="interest" data-interest-input />
      </div>

      <div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="gotcha">Leave this empty</label>
        <input type="text" id="gotcha" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>

      <fieldset class="intake__step" data-step="1">
        <legend class="intake__legend" tabindex="-1"><span class="mono intake__count">Step 1 of 3</span> The problem</legend>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="problem">What's the problem? <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <textarea class="input" id="problem" name="problem" rows="6" required minlength="20" maxlength="4000"
                    placeholder="e.g. We manage all our customer orders through WhatsApp and Excel, and we keep losing track of follow-ups."></textarea>
          <p class="field__hint">A few sentences is plenty. You don't need to know what technology you need; that's our job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intake__nav"><button class="btn" type="button" data-next>Continue {% glyph "00100/00010/11111/00010/00100", "btn__arrow" %}</button></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="intake__step" data-step="2">
        <legend class="intake__legend" tabindex="-1"><span class="mono intake__count">Step 2 of 3</span> A little context <span class="opt">(all optional)</span></legend>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="business">What does your business do?</label>
            <input class="input" id="business" name="business" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. Wholesale bakery supplies" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="currentSolution">How do you handle it today?</label>
            <input class="input" id="currentSolution" name="currentSolution" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. WhatsApp groups and a shared spreadsheet" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="affected">Who is affected?</label>
            <input class="input" id="affected" name="affected" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. Our sales team and our customers" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="frequency">How often does it happen?</label>
            <select class="input" id="frequency" name="frequency">
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              <option>Every day</option>
              <option>A few times a week</option>
              <option>Every week</option>
              <option>Occasionally, but it's costly when it does</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="scale">Roughly how many users or customers?</label>
            <input class="input" id="scale" name="scale" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. 8 staff, about 300 customers" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="existingSystems">Software or website you already use</label>
            <input class="input" id="existingSystems" name="existingSystems" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. Tally, a WordPress site, Google Sheets" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="desiredOutcome">What would “solved” look like?</label>
          <input class="input" id="desiredOutcome" name="desiredOutcome" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. Every order has an owner and nothing falls through the cracks" />
        </div>
        <div class="intake__nav">
          <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back>Back</button>
          <button class="btn" type="button" data-next>Continue {% glyph "00100/00010/11111/00010/00100", "btn__arrow" %}</button>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="intake__step" data-step="3">
        <legend class="intake__legend" tabindex="-1"><span class="mono intake__count">Step 3 of 3</span> Timing and how to reach you</legend>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="budgetRange">Budget range</label>
            <select class="input" id="budgetRange" name="budgetRange">
              <option value="">Not sure yet</option>
              <option>Under ₹25,000</option>
              <option>₹25,000 – ₹75,000</option>
              <option>₹75,000 – ₹2,00,000</option>
              <option>₹2,00,000 – ₹5,00,000</option>
              <option>₹5,00,000+</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="timeline">When do you need it?</label>
            <select class="input" id="timeline" name="timeline">
              <option value="">Flexible</option>
              <option>As soon as possible</option>
              <option>Within 1 month</option>
              <option>Within 3 months</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="urgency">How much is this hurting right now?</label>
          <select class="input" id="urgency" name="urgency">
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>It's costing us money or customers now</option>
            <option>Important, but not urgent</option>
            <option>Just exploring options</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contactName">Your name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input class="input" type="text" id="contactName" name="contactName" required autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contactEmail">Email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input class="input" type="email" id="contactEmail" name="contactEmail" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" maxlength="254" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contactPhone">Phone <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <input class="input" type="tel" id="contactPhone" name="contactPhone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="40" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="company">Company <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <input class="input" type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notice notice--ok" data-form-ok role="status" tabindex="-1" hidden>
          <b>Thanks, we've got it.</b>
          <span>We'll read it properly and reply within 24 hours, usually with a few questions first.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="notice notice--error" data-form-error role="alert" hidden>
          <b>Not sent.</b>
          <span data-form-error-text></span>
        </div>

        <div class="form__submit intake__nav">
          <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back>Back</button>
          <button class="btn" type="submit"><span data-label>Send my problem</span> {% glyph "00100/00010/11111/00010/00100", "btn__arrow" %}</button>
        </div>
        <p class="form__note">We only use this to reply. No mailing lists.</p>
      </fieldset>
    </form>

    <aside class="contact__aside" aria-label="What to expect">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p>
        <ol class="next-steps" role="list">
          <li><b>You describe the problem</b><span>As much or as little detail as you have.</span></li>
          <li><b>We separate facts from guesses</b><span>Within 24 hours you get our understanding back, plus the questions that matter.</span></li>
          <li><b>A short discovery call</b><span>To confirm what we've understood before recommending anything.</span></li>
          <li><b>A clear proposal</b><span>The simplest system that solves it: scope, what's excluded, timeline and price. You approve it or ask for changes.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      {%- if site.email or site.phone or site.whatsapp or site.social.x %}
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Or reach us directly</p>
        <div class="channels">
          {%- if site.email %}<a class="channel" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><span class="mono">Email</span><b>{{ site.email }}</b></a>{% endif %}
          {%- if site.phone %}<a class="channel" href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace(' ', '') }}"><span class="mono">Phone</span><b>{{ site.phone }}</b></a>{% endif %}
          {%- if site.social.x %}<a class="channel" href="{{ site.social.x }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="mono">X</span><b>@{{ site.social.x | replace('https://x.com/', '') }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="visually-hidden">(opens in a new tab)</span></b></a>{% endif %}
          {%- if site.whatsapp %}<a class="channel" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="mono">WhatsApp</span><b>Message us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></b></a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}

      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Recent client</p>
        <a class="channel" href="/projects.html"><span class="mono">Sudaangeo.in</span><b>Website + automation →</b></a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
